      "simplified": "学会了这首歌，记量词容易多了。",
      "traditional": "學會了這首歌，記量詞容易多了。",
      "pinyin": "xué huì le zhè shǒu gē jì liàng cí róng yì duō le",
      "english": "Today, Little Yu taught me a “classifier song”."
